    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> <span data-pf2-check=\"fortitude\" data-pf2-traits=\"disease,curse\" data-pf2-label=\"Insidious Mummy Rot DC\" data-pf2-dc=\"26\" data-pf2-show-dc=\"gm\">Fortitude</span></p>\n<p><em data-visibility=\"gm\">This disease and any damage from it can't be healed until this curse is removed. A creature killed by mummy rot turns to dust and can't be resurrected except by a 7th-level @Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.kqhPt9344UkcGVYO]{Resurrect} ritual or similar magic.</em></p>\n<p><em data-visibility=\"gm\"><strong>Stage 1</strong>, carrier with no ill effect (1 minute)</em></p>\n<p><em data-visibility=\"gm\"><strong>Stage 2</strong>, [[/r 4d6 # negative damage]] negative damage and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} (1 day)</em></p>",
